ity-telemetry']\n799\t  # PRF.CPU CPU performance\n800\t     PRF.CPU.cache | Cache & memory-access optimization | cpu-performance E \n801\t     PRF.CPU.simd | Vectorization audits | cpu-performance E ['math-simd-numerics']\n802\t     PRF.CPU.contention | Contention & false-sharing analysis | cpu-performance E ['concurrency-primitives']\n803\t     PRF.CPU.hybrid | Hybrid-core & power-aware tuning | cpu-performance E ['job-system-task-graph']\n804\t     PRF.CPU.compiler | PGO / LTO & compiler optimization | cpu-performance E ['build-system-toolchains']\n805\t  # PRF.GPU GPU performance\n806\t     PRF.GPU.analysis | Occupancy, bandwidth & cache analysis | gpu-performance E \n807\t     PRF.GPU.overlap | Barrier & async-overlap tuning | gpu-performance E ['render-graph-scheduling']\n808\t     PRF.GPU.tools | Vendor tool expertise across PC, console & mobile | gpu-performance E \n809\t     PRF.GPU.power | GPU power & thermal | gpu-performance E ['platform-mobile-portable']\n810\t  # PRF.LOAD Loading & hitches\n811\t     PRF.LOAD.load-time | Load-time optimization | loading-streaming-performance E \n812\t     PRF.LOAD.hitches | Hitch & stutter elimination (PSO, streaming, GC) | loading-streaming-performance E \n813\t     PRF.LOAD.io | IO throughput analysis | loading-streaming-performance E ['async-io-storage']\n814\t     PRF.LOAD.startup | Startup time | loading-streaming-performance E \n815\t## OBS Observability & diagnostics\n816\t  # OBS.LOG Instrumentation\n817\t     OBS.LOG.logging | Structured logging | observability-telemetry E \n818\t     OBS.LOG.tracing | Trace instrumentation (CPU, GPU, IO, memory zones) | observability-telemetry E \n819\t     OBS.LOG.profilers | Profiler integrations (Tracy, Perfetto, PIX, Superluminal class) | observability-telemetry E \n820\t     OBS.LOG.metrics | Metrics & counters | observability-telemetry E \n821\t     OBS.LOG.stats | In-game stats overlays | observability-telemetry E ['visual-debugging-tools']\n822\t     OBS.LOG.telemetry | Development & live telemetry pipeline | observability-telemetry E \n823\t     OBS.LOG.consent | Telemetry privacy & consent | observability-telemetry E ['security-engineering']\n824\t     OBS.LOG.remote | Remote diagnostics to devices | observability-telemetry E \n825\t  # OBS.CRASH Crash & hang diagnostics\n826\t     OBS.CRASH.capture | Crash capture & minidumps | crash-diagnostics E \n827\t     OBS.CRASH.pipeline | Crash reporting, bucketing & triage | crash-diagnostics E \n828\t     OBS.CRASH.symbolication | Symbolication | crash-diagnostics E ['ci-cd-automation']\n829\t     OBS.CRASH.gpu | GPU crash dumps | crash-diagnostics E ['rhi-core']\n830\t     OBS.CRASH.hangs | Hang & watchdog detection | crash-diagnostics E \n831\t     OBS.CRASH.oom | OOM diagnostics | crash-diagnostics E ['memory-allocators']\n832\t     OBS.CRASH.asserts | Assert & ensure reporting | crash-diagnostics E \n833\t## XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n834\t  # XC.DET Determinism & replay\n835\t     XC.DET.levels | Determinism levels & per-subsystem contract | determinism-replay E \n836\t     XC.DET.float | Floating-point determinism policy (flags, FMA, transcendentals) | determinism-replay E ['math-simd-numerics']\n837\t     XC.DET.parallel | Deterministic parallel execution (ordered reductions) | determinism-replay E ['job-system-task-graph']\n838\t     XC.DET.replay | Input & state record/replay for debugging | determinism-replay E \n839\t     XC.DET.desync | Desync detection & state hashing | determinism-replay E \n840\t     XC.DET.compat | Replay compatibility across builds | determinism-replay E ['api-lifecycle-migration']\n841\t  # XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration\n842\t     XC.ITER.protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration E \n843\t     XC.ITER.live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration E \n844\t     XC.ITER.coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration E \n845\t     XC.ITER.metrics | Iteration-time